      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1b6412c604778296e3408b9e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The tabular structure is represented as such:",
      "sourceHash": "1b6412c604778296e3408b9e52bc889970dbc753c981842d6b3b3b363e358fce",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_34ef7a9f0645df09a408aace_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each child note is a row in the table.",
      "sourceHash": "34ef7a9f0645df09a408aace8415f5fc58d34018ae92cbe08b6da8b0b5113df4",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_17a18a8c7282a710c94229dd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If child rows also have children, they will be displayed under an expander (nested notes).",
      "sourceHash": "17a18a8c7282a710c94229ddc7ae127770dc89dec03a611108d953740047df8c",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e081e8ed5b0ed959fcffb319_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each column is a __TRILIUM_PH_0__promoted attribute__TRILIUM_PH_1__ that is defined on the Collection note.",
      "sourceHash": "e081e8ed5b0ed959fcffb31910197ad8eec6da0fd1f518ce2b85f762ff51b907",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_408832c3566f9cf5d99330d5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Actually, both promoted and unpromoted attributes are supported, but it's a requirement to use a label/relation definition.",
      "sourceHash": "408832c3566f9cf5d99330d576c58dbfc96db0fa43df066d9e78b9f005a56004",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_62339ceebe37cc57a84ef3f9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The promoted attributes are usually defined as inheritable in order to show up in the child notes, but it's not a requirement.",
      "sourceHash": "62339ceebe37cc57a84ef3f97abf83091f805c3348e6c62e7ea08a3a65f47b56",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_08d29b2547a3ce6b3b7ed245_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If there are multiple attribute definitions with the same __TRILIUM_PH_0__, only one will be displayed.",
      "sourceHash": "08d29b2547a3ce6b3b7ed245ed621c48ab6c795eb7291671c6b32469abc8d100",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3f864a03400c71327e15572e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If an attribute definition has multiple values, they will all be grouped under a single column, with chips indicating individual values.",
      "sourceHash": "3f864a03400c71327e15572e04e85552bc313babf50b124efc24e35e91021d41",
      "context": "Table > How it works",
      "contextHash": "fc834716ee3c19039b727bccd6d37502c038befbde303c5e557f231e4be0ba2d",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
